  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000qddu](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000qddu) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jul 18 2025 13km NE of Kyaukmyaung. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 22.6861 longitude 96.0157. It impacted 608891 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
